#: doc/classes/BoxOccluder3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"[BoxOccluder3D] stores a cuboid shape that can be used by the engine's "
"occlusion culling system.\n"
"See [OccluderInstance3D]'s documentation for instructions on setting up "
"occlusion culling."
