msgstr ""
"Basado en [param value], habilita o deshabilita la capa especificada en "
"[member collision_layer], dado un [param layer_number] entre 1 y 32."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
#: modules/gridmap/doc_classes/GridMap.xml doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml
#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml
#: doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Based on [param value], enables or disables the specified layer in the "
