#: doc/classes/Color.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The color's alpha component, typically on the range of 0 to 1. A value of 0 "
"means that the color is fully transparent. A value of 1 means that the color "
"is fully opaque.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The alpha channel is always stored with linear encoding, "
"regardless of the encoding of the other color channels. The [method "
"linear_to_srgb] and [method srgb_to_linear] methods do not affect the alpha "
"channel."
msgstr ""
"El componente alfa del color, normalmente en el rango de 0 a 1. Un valor de "
"0 significa que el color es totalmente transparente. Un valor de 1 significa "
"que el color es totalmente opaco.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El canal alfa siempre se almacena con codificación lineal, "
"independientemente del espacio de color de los otros canales de color. Los "
"métodos [method linear_to_srgb] y [method srgb_to_linear] no afectan al "
"canal alfa."

