"the event is received, the control gains focus.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tgrab_click_focus() # When clicking another Control node, this node will be "
"clicked instead.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGrabClickFocus(); // When clicking another Control node, this node will be "
"clicked instead.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Crea un [InputEventMouseButton] que intenta hacer clic en el control. Si el "
"evento es recibido, el control obtiene el foco.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tgrab_click_focus() # Al hacer clic en otro nodo Control, este nodo será "
"clicado en su lugar.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGrabClickFocus(); // Al hacer clic en otro nodo Control, este nodo será "
"clicado en su lugar.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Steal the focus from another control and become the focused control (see "
"[member focus_mode]).\n"
"If [param hide_focus] is [code]true[/code], the control will not visually "
"show its focused state. Has no effect for [LineEdit] and [TextEdit] when "
"[member ProjectSettings.gui/common/show_focus_state_on_pointer_event] is set "
"to [code]Text Input Controls[/code], or for any control when it is set to "
"[code]Always[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using this method together with [method Callable.call_deferred] "
"makes it more reliable, especially when called inside [method Node._ready]."
msgstr ""
"Roba el foco de otro control y se convierte en el control enfocado (ver "
"[member focus_mode]).\n"
"Si [param hide_focus] es [code]true[/code], el control no mostrará "
"visualmente su estado enfocado. Esto no tiene efecto para [LineEdit] y "
"[TextEdit] cuando [member ProjectSettings.gui/common/"
"show_focus_state_on_pointer_event] está configurado como [code]Control "
"Supports Keyboard Input[/code] (el control soporta entrada de teclado), o "
"para cualquier control cuando está configurado como [code]Always[/code] "
"(siempre).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El uso de este método junto con [method Callable.call_deferred] "
"lo hace más confiable, especialmente cuando se llama dentro de [method "
"Node._ready]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this is the current focused control. See "
"[member focus_mode].\n"
