#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_R16[/code] where there's one component, a 16-"
"bit unsigned normalized integer value. Since the value is normalized, each "
"component is clamped between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] "
"(inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to limited hardware support, it is mainly recommended to be "
"used on desktop or console devices. It may be unsupported on mobile or web, "
"and will consequently be converted to [constant FORMAT_RF]."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]GL_R16[/code] donde hay un componente, un "
"valor entero normalizado sin signo de 16 bits. Dado que el valor está "
"normalizado, cada componente se limita entre [code]0.0[/code] y [code]1.0[/"
"code] (inclusivo).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Debido al soporte limitado de hardware, se recomienda "
"principalmente su uso en dispositivos de escritorio o consola. Puede que no "
"sea compatible en dispositivos móviles o web, y en consecuencia se "
"convertirá a [constant FORMAT_RF]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RG16[/code] where there are two components, "
"each a 16-bit unsigned normalized integer value. Since the value is "
"normalized, each component is clamped between [code]0.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code] (inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to limited hardware support, it is mainly recommended to be "
"used on desktop or console devices. It may be unsupported on mobile or web, "
"and will consequently be converted to [constant FORMAT_RGF]."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]GL_RG16[/code] donde hay dos componentes, "
"cada uno un valor entero normalizado sin signo de 16 bits. Dado que el valor "
"está normalizado, cada componente se limita entre [code]0.0[/code] y "
"[code]1.0[/code] (inclusivo).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Debido al soporte limitado de hardware, se recomienda "
"principalmente su uso en dispositivos de escritorio o consola. Puede que no "
"sea compatible en dispositivos móviles o web, y en consecuencia se "
"convertirá a [constant FORMAT_RGF]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RGB16[/code] where there are three "
"components, each a 16-bit unsigned normalized integer value. Since the value "
"is normalized, each component is clamped between [code]0.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code] (inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to limited hardware support, it is mainly recommended to be "
"used on desktop or console devices. It may be unsupported on mobile or web, "
"and will consequently be converted to [constant FORMAT_RGBF]."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]GL_RGB16[/code] donde hay tres componentes, "
"cada uno un valor entero normalizado sin signo de 16 bits. Dado que el valor "
"está normalizado, cada componente se limita entre [code]0.0[/code] y "
"[code]1.0[/code] (inclusivo).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Debido al soporte limitado de hardware, se recomienda "
"principalmente su uso en dispositivos de escritorio o consola. Puede que no "
"sea compatible en dispositivos móviles o web, y en consecuencia se "
"convertirá a [constant FORMAT_RGBF]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RGBA16[/code] where there are four "
"components, each a 16-bit unsigned normalized integer value. Since the value "
"is normalized, each component is clamped between [code]0.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code] (inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to limited hardware support, it is mainly recommended to be "
"used on desktop or console devices. It may be unsupported on mobile or web, "
"and will consequently be converted to [constant FORMAT_RGBAF]."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]GL_RGBA16[/code] donde hay cuatro "
"componentes, cada uno un valor entero normalizado sin signo de 16 bits. Dado "
"que el valor está normalizado, cada componente se limita entre [code]0.0[/"
"code] y [code]1.0[/code] (inclusivo).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Debido al soporte de hardware limitado, se recomienda "
"principalmente su uso en dispositivos de escritorio o consola. Puede no ser "
"compatible en dispositivos móviles o web, y consecuentemente se convertirá a "
"[constant FORMAT_RGBAF]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_R16UI[/code] where there's one component, a "
"16-bit unsigned integer value. Each component is clamped between [code]0[/"
"code] and [code]65535[/code] (inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used in a shader, the texture requires usage of "
"[code]usampler[/code] samplers. Additionally, it only supports nearest-"
"neighbor filtering under the Compatibility renderer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When sampling using [method Image.get_pixel], returned [Color]s "
"have to be divided by [code]65535[/code] to get the correct color value."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]GL_R16UI[/code] donde hay un componente, un "
"valor entero sin signo de 16 bits. Cada componente se limita entre [code]0[/"
"code] y [code]65535[/code] (inclusivo).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Cuando se usa en un shader, la textura requiere el uso de "
"samplers [code]usampler[/code]. Además, solo soporta filtrado por vecino más "
"cercano bajo el renderizador Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Al muestrear usando [method Image.get_pixel], los [Color]s "
"devueltos deben dividirse por [code]65535[/code] para obtener el valor de "
"color correcto."

