msgstr ""
"Devuelve los vértices del contorno para el [param obstacle] especificado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], the provided [param obstacle] "
"affects avoidance using agents."
