#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid "Set the motion range (if supported) limiting the hand motion."
msgstr ""
"Establece el rango de movimiento (si es compatible) limitando el movimiento "
"de la mano."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid ""
"Set the type of skeleton rig the [member hand_skeleton] is compliant with."
msgstr ""
