"an ORM texture."
msgstr ""
"Un material PBR (Physically Based Rendering) que se utiliza en objetos 3D. "
"Utiliza una textura ORM."

#: doc/classes/ORMMaterial3D.xml
msgid ""
"ORMMaterial3D's properties are inherited from [BaseMaterial3D]. Unlike "
"[StandardMaterial3D], ORMMaterial3D uses a single texture for ambient "
"occlusion, roughness and metallic maps, known as an ORM texture."
msgstr ""
"Las propiedades de ORMMaterial3D se heredan de [BaseMaterial3D]. A "
"diferencia de [StandardMaterial3D], ORMMaterial3D utiliza una sola textura "
