"milliseconds). In most situations, [member application/run/max_fps] should "
"be preferred as an FPS limiter as it's more precise.\n"
"This setting can be overridden using the [code]--frame-delay <ms;>[/code] "
"command line argument."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
