"enabled.\n"
"- [code]DEFAULT[/code]: The default optimized method.\n"
"- [code]Legacy[/code]: The previous reference method used for scene tree "
"traversal, which is slower.\n"
"- [code]Debug[/code]: Swaps between [code]DEFAULT[/code] and [code]Legacy[/"
"code] methods on alternating frames, and provides logging information (which "
"in turn makes it slower). Intended for debugging only; you should use the "
"[code]DEFAULT[/code] method in most cases."
msgstr ""

