"spir/]SPIR-V[/url] code for various shader stages, as well as possible "
"compilation error messages. SPIR-V is a low-level intermediate shader "
"representation. This intermediate representation is not used directly by "
"GPUs for rendering, but it can be compiled into binary shaders that GPUs can "
"understand. Unlike compiled shaders, SPIR-V is portable across GPU models "
"and driver versions.\n"
"This object is used by [RenderingDevice]."
