"mínima.\n"
"El icono del divisor se oculta automáticamente si la longitud del icono del "
"divisor es mayor que la barra divisoria."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The split dragger icon is never visible regardless of the value of "
"[theme_item autohide].\n"
"The size of the grabber icon determines the minimum [theme_item separation]."
msgstr ""
"El icono del divisor nunca es visible independientemente del valor de "
"[theme_item autohide].\n"
"El tamaño del icono del divisor determina la [theme_item separation] mínima."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The split dragger icon is not visible, and the split bar is collapsed to "
